SY_TALK("j-5np0zOtm0",[[0,["Again it gives me great pleasure to introduce to you again"]],[3,["Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[7,["For those of you who have been coming regularly"]],[9,["to the series these last two nights and tonight,"]],[15,["I think many of you will have experienced Self-realization."]],[20,["For those of you who haven’t, don’t despair,"]],[23,["because it can be worked out in everyone."]],[27,["Not everyone"]],[30,["keeps that gift of Self-realization,"]],[34,["because, very foolishly, when we touch it,"]],[38,["we let it go, we squander it, or perhaps we don’t develop it"]],[42,["in a way in which that seeking that lies within us would desire."]],[49,["But whatever it is,"]],[51,["most of us who get this experience of Self-realization"]],[55,["come to a point where logically they reach the conclusion"]],[59,["that there must be something that has happened within me,"]],[63,["which has taken me into this new dimension of awareness."]],[67,["In my own case, when I experienced Self-realization …"]],[75,["it was a very remarkable experience because I gained my experience"]],[81,["from Mataji, in Her presence, in India."]],[85,["But the events that led up to that were quite interesting."]],[88,["Because, as practicing"]],[91,["professional in health care, looking after lots of patients,"]],[96,["I was able to watch a lot of those patients"]],[99,["who were going to India, going to America,"]],[101,["going to various places of Spiritual pilgrimage all over the world."]],[105,["And many of them were coming back —"]],[108,["quite curiously to me at that time —"]],[110,["quite damaged and quite in a state"]],[114,["of mental and physical disarray."]],[119,["I had done a lot of reading about seeking,"]],[122,["I had read a lot about Eastern religion,"]],[126,["I had read, of course, the Christian scriptures,"]],[130,["I’d also read extensively the Koran."]],[135,["But I was watching what was happening to my patients,"]],[140,["to these people who were coming back with physical problems"]],[143,["and especially psychological problems,"]],[146,["and psychosexual problems,"]],[148,["which were far worse than when they went away."]],[152,["But having done the reading,"]],[154,["having read about these so-called masters"]],[159,["that are granting Self-realization — so-called —"]],[163,["or the experience, or the promise, or some such thing,"]],[167,["I was curious to find out"]],[169,["why it was that these people seemed to be a lot worse off."]],[174,["Worse off, not better."]],[175,["And this was from a purely rational point of view:"]],[178,["at that stage I hadn’t gained my Self-realization."]],[181,["So"]],[183,["I was given to believe that many of them"]],[188,["who had these experiences were actually purifying themselves."]],[192,["That was one explanation."]],[194,["Other explanations were that it was a process of growth"]],[197,["in which you have to re-experience so many of, for example,"]],[201,["your childhood experiences, or repressions, or whatever it was."]],[208,["And this seemed to be, I suppose,"]],[210,["to a rational mind that wanted explanations for things,"]],[214,["reasonably sensible."]],[217,["But I still couldn’t come to terms with why these people"]],[221,["were really — if I could use the word — quite freakish"]],[224,["when they came back from these so-called pilgrimages."]],[228,["So I went myself."]],[231,["I went to the ashrams of these so-called sat gurus,"]],[236,["I went to the places where hundreds of my own fellow countrymen"]],[241,["and dozens of my own patients actually reside,"]],[246,["where they live, where they have regarded it as their Spiritual home."]],[251,["And they live a most remarkable life."]],[254,["They live a life which is, to my way of thinking —"]],[257,["from a purely Western,"]],[260,["but perhaps a more universal point of view —"]],[264,["a very sick life."]],[266,["I watched the depraved things that go on in the ashrams."]],[270,["I watched the mental sickness which was manifesting everywhere."]],[276,["I watched them using sexual and other,"]],[280,["rather bizarre techniques for the so-called awakening of Kundalini."]],[285,["Because I knew that Kundalini had to be awakened. That much I knew."]],[290,["I was also very worried about this whole notion of Kundalini"]],[293,["because all the books that I’d read were … somewhat …"]],[299,["scaring because they had suggested"]],[301,["that Kundalini is a dangerous energy that you mustn’t play with,"]],[305,["and that when it’s awakened it can lead to all sorts"]],[308,["of mental and physical disorders, and so on and so forth."]],[311,["So I had all these sorts of conditionings."]],[314,["But what I saw in fact in these places"]],[317,["was nothing but a nonsense."]],[320,["Watching them dancing to this subliminal music,"]],[325,["which, in fact, damages the brain cells;"]],[329,["using strobe lights, which damage the cells of the back of the eye;"]],[336,["using tantric techniques of so-called sexual kind"]],[342,["that are “awakening” the Kundalini;"]],[347,["people going into contortions;"]],[349,["but worse than anything, people getting mesmerized."]],[353,["This was the most frightening part."]],[355,["Watching an hour-long “technique” — and that was what it was —"]],[359,["whereby the “guru” mesmerized his audience,"]],[362,["it reminded me, in fact, of much of what I’d read of Hitler,"]],[367,["and it really disturbed me."]],[369,["I went from one to the other."]],[372,["I don’t mind naming them: I went to Rajneesh,"]],[374,["I went to Muktananda, I went to all of these different places."]],[378,["I went to Sai Baba’s ashram."]],[380,["I, thank God, was never initiated by them,"]],[383,["nor did I see any sign of them."]],[386,["They were in America,"]],[388,["living their luxurious life."]],[391,["But the disciples were there. And they were in a horrible state."]],[395,["Many of my patients were there, and they were very very damaged."]],[400,["So from one to the other I went, forming increasingly"]],[405,["a view which ranged from disillusionment to total disgust."]],[409,["If this was Spiritual seeking,"]],[412,["then I just wanted to forget it."]],[414,["So I virtually abandoned the idea"]],[419,["of finding out in India"]],[421,["because it seemed to me to be a just one big joke,"]],[424,["a very sick joke."]],[426,["People like Rajneesh were practicing"]],[430,["nothing but sexual pranks and pseudo-psychology"]],[433,["as the means of awakening this energy,"]],[438,["which of course it doesn’t do."]],[440,["In fact, what happens is the very deities"]],[444,["that William Doble has just spoken of"]],[446,["recede from those centers in a very very angry way,"]],[450,["and you feel fire and burning and all sorts of negative experiences"]],[456,["at the hands of these “gurus”."]],[460,["I came to the conclusion very clearly that I wandered away"]],[463,["from this situation."]],[465,["In fact, I very quickly came to the conclusion"]],[468,["that these must be, in fact, the antichrists."]],[471,["Because the very thing that I had been seeking,"]],[476,["that very beautiful experience of Self-realization,"]],[481,["was at best no more than a promise,"]],[485,["and at worst was, in fact, absolute damage"]],[488,["to either the psyche or the physical body."]],[492,["And so,"]],[495,["I was about to come home, I had my flight booked back,"]],[498,["and I also had the telephone number of Shri Mataji."]],[504,["I telephoned to Her."]],[506,["Something in me said, “Give one more a chance,”"]],[511,["and this precisely what I did."]],[514,["I went to Her."]],[516,["In fact, I gave Her a telephone call, and at the other end"]],[519,["was a very warm, loving voice,"]],[522,["who simply invited me to come over and to meet Her."]],[526,["And this I did, in Bombay."]],[530,["And after a very beautiful hour or so"]],[533,["in which there were grandchildren scrambling all over Her,"]],[536,["in which there were all sorts of very very normal things"]],[540,["happening around Her,"]],[542,["She invited me to come to the Sahaja Yoga center in Bombay"]],[545,["and to experience the realization that I’d been seeking."]],[550,["By that time I was feeling very relaxed, I was feeling calm,"]],[554,["and I certainly wanted to experience what She had to offer."]],[559,["I hope you bear with me in telling this story because it’s a story"]],[562,["which lies behind the pain and the agony"]],[566,["which so many people have suffered in their seeking,"]],[571,["in their disillusionment with their seeking,"]],[574,["and it reflects just one such person who —"]],[579,["but for the grace of God, but for the grace of the Mother —"]],[584,["would perhaps have been lost in this round of human existence."]],[590,["We’re at a crisis point."]],[593,["All the great incarnations have spoken"]],[595,["of the great time of confusion,"]],[598,["of the time when there would be these antichrists on the earth."]],[604,["They are here — to seduce the seekers."]],[609,["These are very strong words,"]],[611,["but they are here to seduce the seekers."]],[613,["They’re here to mesmerize, they’re here to confuse."]],[620,["And we have every evidence of it."]],[623,["From Pune,"]],[624,["there has been one gentleman — if we can call him that —"]],[628,["who has had to run away."]],[630,["The BBC did a documentary on the subject"]],[633,["called “The god who ran away”."]],[635,["And they call him Bhagwan."]],[637,["And he’s now settled down in Oregon, in America."]],[640,["And the American government don’t want him either:"]],[642,["they’ve given him a deportation order."]],[644,["He might come here. You people should take a responsible stand."]],[650,["There is another one who claims to be the incarnation"]],[652,["of the Lord Jesus Christ."]],[654,["He was a little fat boy who, at the age of sixteen,"]],[657,["started a mission."]],[661,["First he married his secretary who was nineteen,"]],[664,["then he had a squabble with his mother and his brother,"]],[667,["and they wrangled for the position of power."]],[669,["And finally he settled down in Denver City and in Florida,"]],[675,["and he has literally thousands and thousands and thousands of people"]],[680,["who are awaiting so-called knowledge, whatever that might be."]],[687,["There are so many."]],[688,["There is one “guru” who lives in Bangalore,"]],[691,["who plucks diamonds out of the air"]],[694,["and offers them to American tourists."]],[697,["He calls himself the incarnation of Kalki."]],[703,["He’s a man known to have certain sexual deviations,"]],[708,["which have been written up extensively"]],[710,["by many people who’ve been there."]],[712,["There’s a man who died recently called Muktananda,"]],[715,["who died of a massive heart attack."]],[718,["What great saint would die of a massive heart attack?"]],[723,["What great saint would need a bypass valving his heart"]],[727,["for the last fifteen years?"]],[731,["What man who called himself a saint would have a dirty disease?"]],[735,["I ask us all"]],[738,["to be very rational about this, to use our brains"]],[742,["and to openly oppose these false gurus."]],[747,["Take a stand on the subject because they are the ones"]],[751,["who are going to damage these young people"]],[753,["who are coming up in the world today."]],[755,["Many of us — I’m forty-seven years of age —"]],[758,["many of us at this age,"]],[762,["all right, we’ve made our mistakes."]],[766,["With the grace of Mother, those mistakes are going to be repaired."]],[771,["The effects are going to be neutralized,"]],[773,["the damage is going to be fixed up."]],[776,["Not so much from these false gurus,"]],[780,["not so much from them,"]],[782,["because we missed out, thank God,"]],[785,["but many of the young people today"]],[788,["are part and parcel of this whole"]],[791,["mesmeric nightmare that’s going on against our evolution."]],[796,["And we owe it to the young people, who are in their twenties,"]],[801,["in their teens, and the young children,"]],[804,["who could be very seriously damaged."]],[807,["Mataji, as you know, speaks openly against these fake gurus."]],[813,["She has done, since Her message began in 1970,"]],[818,["She has named them,"]],[820,["She has said who they were in their previous births."]],[824,["She has warned the sort of diseases that they cause in the seekers,"]],[828,["many of which She has had to cure."]],[832,["So, in contrast to that beautiful"]],[838,["optimistic potential,"]],[843,["which we all have,"]],[845,["and which Mother has granted to most of us,"]],[849,["so many of the people who miss out"]],[852,["and do not get their realization,"]],[856,["contrary to our possibilities,"]],[859,["so many people are going to be lost."]],[863,["And I urge each and every one of you people"]],[866,["who get your realization, who develop their realization,"]],[870,["to take a stand, to speak out against these people."]],[874,["When you hear them come to your city to lecture,"]],[879,["when you hear people conversing about them,"]],[882,["when you hear people defending them, take a stand."]],[886,["How many people sitting in this audience may have been"]],[890,["someone in the crowd at the time of the Lord Jesus Christ"]],[893,["and did not have the courage that even Peter may have had?"]],[898,["How many of us can sit comfortably in the chair and say"]],[901,["that “I will take a stand"]],[904,["when it comes to this nonsense that’s going on in the society,"]],[908,["when it’s anti-God in its nature and its effect”?"]],[914,["As I said, I’m a professional person."]],[916,["All Sahaja Yogis are professional people"]],[919,["or, in some sense, working people, in a very very normal way."]],[925,["And we don’t believe in stupid attitudes and practices"]],[929,["such as sannyas,"]],[930,["wearing clothes that are specially designed for the guru,"]],[934,["giving him Rolls-Royces,"]],[936,["a hundred other,"]],[938,["rather ridiculous tactics that are employed."]],[942,["We reject this nonsense."]],[945,["And in its place we have Mother."]],[948,["Mother, who is the one who Christ spoke about"]],[954,["as the one who would come as the Counsellor, the Comforter,"]],[958,["the Holy Spirit who would teach us all things."]],[961,["She’s the one who can do the job, in a very very simple way,"]],[964,["as I said last night."]],[966,["You feel this manifestation of the cool wind of the Holy Spirit"]],[971,["you feel it on your central nervous system, consciously."]],[975,["You begin to have the manifestation which all the great teachers"]],[980,["who came on this earth said we had to look for."]],[984,["Mohammed said it is the Ruh that has to be looked for."]],[993,["And Bill has spoken of all the others."]],[996,["“At this resurrection time our hands have to speak” —"]],[1000,["all of these things."]],[1002,["We have so many Muslims, Hindus, Christian, Buddhist —"]],[1007,["people who belong to Sahaja Yoga and who now have finally"]],[1011,["been liberated from that limitation of any one sect,"]],[1016,["or denomination, or group."]],[1020,["This is the long-awaited experience,"]],[1023,["which you’ve all been waiting for."]],[1025,["As I said, so many of you"]],[1027,["have probably been a Christian, a Jew, a Hindu;"]],[1032,["you’ve probably stood in the crowd — silently, knowing the truth —"]],[1038,["in those incarnations where you’ve been seeking."]],[1041,["Now you’ve come to this point in your evolution"]],[1043,["where all you have to do is, by the grace of God,"]],[1048,["by the grace of God, get it."]],[1053,["In the form of the Mother,"]],[1057,["that grace has come."]],[1059,["That grace flows on your hands,"]],[1062,["it flows from the top of your head."]],[1066,["It neutralizes negativity,"]],[1069,["it dissolves"]],[1071,["all those things in us which are against our evolution,"]],[1075,["and it gives us the bliss, that is the Spirit."]],[1079,["Ladies and gentlemen, again I introduce to you"]],[1083,["Her Holiness Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[1110,["To all the seekers of truth I bow."]],[1119,["Dr. Reeves has spoken rather strongly today."]],[1124,["I think he is a very great Australian"]],[1128,["to have that kind of a wisdom"]],[1131,["to see through the nonsense and the mockery"]],[1136,["that people were inflicting"]],[1139,["on simple naive seekers from abroad."]],[1144,["It requires a great intelligence"]],[1152,["and common sense to see through that."]],[1156,["But the greatest of all is the desire"]],[1160,["to do good to others,"]],[1163,["to be touched by the agonies of others,"]],[1167,["to be upset what others are suffering."]],[1171,["This is the biggest thing,"]],[1173,["that really brings you to the right point of understanding."]],[1181,["What he said is absolute truth."]],[1184,["I’ve been to all these gurus to find out what they have been up to."]],[1188,["And they have been telling everyone that “She was my disciple.”"]],[1190,["Another said, “She was my disciple.”"]],[1193,["I just wanted to find out"]],[1195,["what are they doing to these people,"]],[1201,["how are they grabbing them,"]],[1204,["and what are they managing."]],[1208,["I knew the divine path, I knew the holy path, the pure path,"]],[1213,["but I didn’t know the path of the crooks,"]],[1217,["of the antichrist,"]],[1219,["and actually I had to find it out Myself."]],[1223,["And that’s how I went to all these people"]],[1226,["in a garb that “I have come to learn” — they never recognized Me."]],[1231,["What you do and all those things."]],[1233,["And that’s how I have been able to find out methods,"]],[1238,["in the permutation, combinations of your barriers,"]],[1242,["how to achieve en masse realization."]],[1247,["In the beginning of My life, I started with normal, common people,"]],[1252,["intelligent people, educated people in all walks of life."]],[1257,["I had to go through various types of phases,"]],[1260,["in which I met all types of people,"]],[1264,["and I could, through My subtle methods,"]],[1266,["find out what are the barriers."]],[1269,["But the worst of all,"]],[1271,["which concerned Me the most of all,"]],[1274,["was that the great seekers of the ancient times"]],[1278,["have gone into such mesmerism,"]],[1283,["into such ego-pampering processes"]],[1290,["that how will they retreat back?"]],[1293,["It was a big concern to Me."]],[1297,["I have tried —"]],[1300,["after getting so many normal people first to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1305,["then to these combinations —"]],[1308,["I must confess"]],[1311,["that it is not easy to give realization to people"]],[1314,["who have been to those gurus."]],[1317,["Day in and day out"]],[1319,["I have to work out the permutations and combinations of barriers,"]],[1323,["of terrible barriers within them."]],[1327,["It’s not an easy thing,"]],[1329,["but, thank God, I have achieved it"]],[1333,["by My own love and concern."]],[1339,["Still I must tell you: those who belong to some guru"]],[1343,["are very difficult people for realization."]],[1347,["Last year in Melbourne"]],[1349,["we had about, I think, fifty people like that,"]],[1353,["and it was impossible to give them realization;"]],[1358,["and they even tried their level best —"]],[1361,["they found it difficult to get it,"]],[1362,["while a drunkard could get it in no time,"]],[1367,["an alcoholic could get it in no time,"]],[1370,["a prostitute could get it in no time."]],[1373,["Can you imagine?"]],[1375,["What harm is done within yourself"]],[1379,["that it is not easy to give them realization!"]],[1383,["And even if they get realization —"]],[1385,["because they are so ego-oriented — they fall back."]],[1389,["They mock, that’s the only thing they can do."]],[1393,["They are least bothered about their own realization."]],[1396,["They are not bothered. They are identified with that idea"]],[1400,["that they belong to some sort of a cult,"]],[1403,["and they always try to be with them."]],[1406,["Even in Perth we went, then in Adelaide,"]],[1410,["I found these, some of them, are paid by gurus"]],[1413,["to come and disturb us."]],[1416,["To that extent these people, who are seekers of God, are going down."]],[1422,["They have no eyes, no sensitivity to feel what is the truth."]],[1427,["And they are not bothered about their own well-being."]],[1430,["This is the worst thing that is happening to them."]],[1434,["It’s a thing of concern. Every time I have an interview anywhere —"]],[1438,["in Australia, America, anywhere — they ask Me such questions"]],[1442,["that “Why not your government stops these things?"]],[1447,["Why not your government do something about these people?"]],[1450,["They have amassed so much of money.”"]],[1451,["This Muktananda now, we have learnt, officially, he has got"]],[1456,["sixty thousand rupees worth of diamonds,"]],[1462,["and both the disciples are fighting for it."]],[1469,["Still, you see, it is impossible for people to accept"]],[1473,["that “Whatever has happened has happened,"]],[1475,["it’s a naiveness we went into. Let us get to the real thing.”"]],[1481,["They just can’t think of it."]],[1484,["And anything that guru says, they listen to it,"]],[1487,["not even logically think about it."]],[1490,["Moreover, if you talk to them, they don’t know anything about reality."]],[1494,["Now, as you have seen Warren,"]],[1496,["then you have seen William,"]],[1498,["there are all these Sahaja Yogis who are equipped"]],[1501,["with complete knowledge about Kundalini,"]],[1503,["how to give realization and how to cure people, what are the problems."]],[1507,["I mean, William, I had never told him anything about it as such."]],[1512,["But he has given realization to so many people in your Melbourne."]],[1517,["So you start manifesting your own powers,"]],[1520,["and you don’t live on some sort of an ego"]],[1522,["that you belong to some cult or anything,"]],[1524,["but you belong to yourself."]],[1527,["Every individual becomes a beautiful flower."]],[1530,["That’s what we have to expect within ourselves."]],[1533,["That’s what really you are seeking."]],[1535,["Not to be called into this guru or that guru"]],[1538,["but your own guru within yourself — is your Spirit,"]],[1541,["is the Shiva’s Spirit within you."]],[1547,["Today, of course, he has already told you"]],[1549,["about these three centers which I would like to deal with you."]],[1557,["The first center that I dealt"]],[1560,["and the second and third are very important,"]],[1563,["but these higher centers"]],[1568,["are playing a very vital role in our being."]],[1575,["The one which is the Heart center"]],[1580,["is looking after"]],[1585,["the security of God’s children."]],[1593,["When a person sees something horrible,"]],[1598,["this center starts pulsating fast."]],[1601,["Till the age of twelve years,"]],[1605,["the sternum bone, which is placed in the ribs here, as you know,"]],[1611,["creates antibodies to fight any invasion within,"]],[1617,["whether mental, emotional, or physical."]],[1621,["These antibodies get distributed, till the age of twelve years,"]],[1626,["throughout your body."]],[1632,["And when this sternum gets the message,"]],[1638,["it starts shaking,"]],[1641,["and it conveys, communicates, through no …"]],[1647,["nerves or arteries or veins — any connection known so far —"]],[1652,["to these antibodies that they should all fight."]],[1656,["They fight the disease,"]],[1658,["they fight also the things what you call possessions."]],[1664,["They also fight your own mistakes."]],[1671,["That’s why this is a very important center within us."]],[1677,["If a lady is an insecure woman,"]],[1682,["if she feels insecure,"]],[1685,["then this center is always in a pulsating mood."]],[1689,["And that’s how it makes all the antibodies very tired,"]],[1694,["because they are all the time in a state of emergency."]],[1700,["Also these cults have used"]],[1703,["this method of putting people onto emergency:"]],[1707,["give them exercises where they jump, jump, jump, or something like that."]],[1711,["Now, you can ask any doctor,"]],[1713,["this kind of jumping without any support"]],[1715,["can create impotency in a personality."]],[1721,["Now, this is very physically used method by these people,"]],[1725,["to make them nervous"]],[1729,["by making this center go very fast."]],[1735,["Now, when these antibodies are tired,"]],[1738,["they become absolutely numbed down,"]],[1741,["and they cannot find any strength to fight any aggression."]],[1747,["Now, in everyday life also,"]],[1750,["if some lady, as I told you, is nervous,"]],[1753,["and she has problem, and she’s always afraid,"]],[1758,["then what happens — that this system"]],[1764,["starts exerting itself too much;"]],[1767,["ultimately it gets sick,"]],[1770,["and then she can develop a disease called the breast cancer."]],[1777,["This breast cancer is very common nowadays"]],[1781,["among women in the West."]],[1784,["Because the motherhood of the lady is challenged."]],[1790,["This center is bestowed upon"]],[1793,["by the deity of Mother of the Universe."]],[1799,["And when the lady finds that her motherhood is challenged,"]],[1806,["then she starts feeling very nervous,"]],[1810,["this center goes into over-activity,"]],[1815,["and then she developed this cancer of the breast,"]],[1820,["troubles of the breast, all kinds of such troubles."]],[1823,["Because the antibodies have become now very weak."]],[1831,["On the left-hand side of this center"]],[1837,["is the center what we call as the left Heart center."]],[1842,["But beyond that is residing the Spirit,"]],[1847,["in your heart, in the organ, separated from everyone."]],[1853,["The Spirit is the reflection of God Almighty within yourself."]],[1861,["And the Kundalini is the Holy Ghost,"]],[1866,["which is the Power of God,"]],[1869,["which is the Primordial Mother,"]],[1872,["expressed within you as the Kundalini."]],[1878,["So we have got within us that power, shakti,"]],[1883,["and the Shiva, sitting in your heart."]],[1888,["So this Kundalini has to rise to give you realization."]],[1893,["The baptism, the real baptism. Not an artificial one."]],[1899,["Now, how it can happen in a person is a problem."]],[1905,["It used to happen. What knowledge I am telling you"]],[1908,["is not the knowledge of today."]],[1911,["Is the knowledge of very very ancient times."]],[1914,["Fourteen thousand years back,"]],[1916,["Markandeya, a great poet in India, has written about it."]],[1921,["After that"]],[1924,["there were many other poets who wrote about it,"]],[1927,["till, in the sixth century, Adi Shankaracharya"]],[1930,["very clearly wrote about the Kundalini and its awakening."]],[1934,["Nobody has said so far,"]],[1937,["from those ancient writers, that Kundalini gives you any problems,"]],[1943,["or she makes you dance, jump and all that — is all modern nonsense."]],[1950,["Traditionally, nobody has said so."]],[1954,["Sixth century is the time"]],[1956,["when Adi Shankaracharya incarnated on this earth."]],[1960,["Buddha got His realization without doing any dancing or anything."]],[1966,["You know for definite."]],[1969,["So this new idea of all these happenings"]],[1973,["come by a generation of these horrible people"]],[1977,["in the last fifty years."]],[1980,["I would say there has been a Holy Trinity"]],[1982,["as well as a Unholy Trinity."]],[1985,["These people preceded the others who were to come,"]],[1989,["to execute what they wanted to do."]],[1992,["These antichrists had two type of things,"]],[1995,["because … how to neutralize also the writings of the ancient times."]],[2001,["Like Freud — was one of them."]],[2006,["There are some more. They came down like this"]],[2009,["and wrote some things to uproot human beings completely,"]],[2013,["first of all, from reality."]],[2017,["And then another lot came in"]],[2021,["for using that as a written thing for them —"]],[2026,["because writing is something great —"]],[2029,["and then preaching what these people have preached,"]],[2033,["using that as a base to express themselves."]],[2038,["You see, all hand-in-gloves knowledge."]],[2043,["But if you read any ancient book —"]],[2046,["which many are not translated…"]],[2050,["Because nobody’s interested in that!"]],[2055,["They diverted all our attention from the sublime"]],[2058,["to absolutely wretched life."]],[2062,["And this uprooting has taken place"]],[2064,["because these are antichrist activities;"]],[2068,["they are all joined together, they never talk against each other,"]],[2071,["that’s one thing great about them."]],[2073,["And Christ has said"]],[2075,["that Satan is not going to talk against his own house."]],[2081,["They praise each other, meet each other,"]],[2083,["I’ve seen them behaving like that."]],[2085,["Give them presents, this one gives presents to another —"]],[2088,["big fraternity exists between them."]],[2090,["Great fraternity, no problem between them."]],[2094,["But the real saints in India,"]],[2096,["who are living in the forest and Himalayas,"]],[2102,["into the hills and dales, I should say,"]],[2105,["hidden away from … you people,"]],[2113,["are just quite aware that these are antichrist."]],[2121,["The first thing that happened when these people"]],[2123,["started manifesting themselves — India is very good at astrology,"]],[2128,["so, as soon as their birth date came in, they just cast their… horoscope"]],[2132,["and said, “Now let’s see what’s in their horoscope.”"]],[2136,["So, most of them changed their birth dates also."]],[2141,["Nothing consistent!"]],[2144,["And when you ask them, “Why are you not consistent?”"]],[2146,["they said change is the way the life is."]],[2151,["But that is life. You are talking of something eternal."]],[2155,["How can eternal change?"]],[2160,["It’s very difficult"]],[2162,["to make people take to eternal life"]],[2167,["than to make them take to just mundane life. You know that."]],[2170,["Now, see, there’s a show on today. How many cars there are!"]],[2175,["And how many people there are to see that!"]],[2177,["But to take to real life, it takes time,"]],[2180,["otherwise why is it all the great saints"]],[2183,["and all the great prophets and incarnations"]],[2188,["were tortured by human beings?"]],[2191,["Why did they torture them?"]],[2194,["So this is one of the things one has to realize —"]],[2197,["that the Spirit resides in your heart."]],[2201,["Which is the Sat-chit-ananda, as they say —"]],[2204,["is the one which is the truth,"]],[2207,["which is the attention,"]],[2209,["and which is the joy."]],[2215,["Now, first of all, we must understand what is attention."]],[2220,["What is “God who is an attention”, what does that mean."]],[2225,["“God who is the attention” means"]],[2229,["God knows about everything that’s happening."]],[2235,["He is aware of what is happening in this world."]],[2241,["He's the only spectator of the drama of life,"]],[2247,["which is created by His Power, the Primordial Mother."]],[2252,["He knows each and everything about us;"]],[2255,["whatever He wants to know, He can find out,"]],[2257,["there is no problem about it."]],[2260,["So He is the knower,"]],[2263,["and He is the knowledge too."]],[2267,["So, when we become realized,"]],[2270,["we have to know through our awareness:"]],[2276,["we have to become collectively conscious."]],[2279,["And this is a very important point which we must remember."]],[2283,["It’s not very difficult to understand"]],[2287,["that you have to become something more."]],[2290,["Only by wearing some dress"]],[2292,["or putting something in your neck what do you become?"]],[2294,["Some people tell Me, “We lead a very good life, Mother,"]],[2297,["so it should be all right.”"]],[2302,["But “good life” is according to your concept."]],[2306,["Even according to the divine concept,"]],[2309,["if it is a good life — for what?"]],[2312,["Everybody will ask, “For what?"]],[2313,["Why do you want to lead such a religious life, for what?"]],[2317,["What is the need to have such a life?”"]],[2320,["One should ask oneself, “Why to lead such a life"]],[2322,["which is so conditioned?”"]],[2326,["The answer is, you have to have balance to ascend."]],[2330,["If you do not ascend, what’s the use"]],[2332,["of building up this balance within you?"]],[2336,["The purpose is to ascend."]],[2339,["If you cannot transcend,"]],[2343,["then this is just a binding, your mental projection"]],[2347,["that you should lead this kind of life and that kind of life."]],[2349,["It’s just your mental process."]],[2352,["But when the Spirit ascends,"]],[2356,["then all the religions are born within you."]],[2360,["They get enlightenment. You just don’t do things which are wrong."]],[2364,["Just don’t do it, you just don’t like it."]],[2367,["As we have told you that there are people who gave up"]],[2370,["their drugs and things overnight. Is a fact!"]],[2374,["Because, as soon as this happens,"]],[2378,["the enlightenment brings forth"]],[2383,["complete new awareness"]],[2387,["which refuses to have anything that is not good for this body."]],[2392,["You just have the things that are good for your body, for your life."]],[2398,["You don’t have to fight with yourself"]],[2400,["that “Oh God, how will I give up?” In the morning you say,"]],[2403,["“I will not drink in the night,” but in the night you drink."]],[2408,["So, in the beginning there is no need in Sahaja Yoga today"]],[2412,["to say that “Don’t do this and don’t do that.”"]],[2415,["There’s no need at all."]],[2417,["Once it is enlightened within you, you just look after yourself."]],[2422,["But when the Spirit starts coming in your attention,"]],[2425,["you become collectively conscious, and you know."]],[2429,["You know, again. It’s not mental projection."]],[2433,["You know about yourself."]],[2436,["You know what centers are catching, on your fingers you can tell."]],[2439,["Fingertips, you can say. You know on your fingertips."]],[2444,["And you know about others also."]],[2446,["And also, if you really learn the complete technique —"]],[2451,["which is very easy to learn, within a week you can learn it —"]],[2454,["you can help another and yourself very well"]],[2458,["to rise above this level to a higher level."]],[2463,["People have all kinds of fears these days."]],[2466,["It’s a very abnormal situation."]],[2469,["They don’t have any joy. Only fear. They live with fear."]],[2472,["They were telling Me there’s a person who cannot live out"]],[2475,["in the space, then there’s fear of even building bad oxygen,"]],[2480,["then they have fear of germ touching them,"]],[2483,["and all those things are there. They have lost confidence in life."]],[2488,["By awakening of this center within you,"]],[2491,["you become absolutely a normal person."]],[2494,["You have no fears."]],[2497,["Because nothing that is wrong can attack you."]],[2501,["You are well prepared for it."]],[2504,["There’s a strength within you which really"]],[2507,["makes you very confident."]],[2511,["That’s why this center is very important"]],[2514,["for us to know that this center"]],[2518,["gives us that strength, that confidence."]],[2523,["The other day — every program —"]],[2526,["they asked Me another question:"]],[2528,["“What do You think about Australians?”"]],[2531,["Which is a very very common question, I’ve found."]],[2535,["I said that they are great people, very nice people."]],[2539,["But they lack only one thing — is complete confidence in themselves."]],[2544,["They haven’t got that confidence that they should have."]],[2547,["They are not aggressive people, they are not worried"]],[2550,["about aggressing other territories or anything."]],[2553,["But a kind of a diffidence is still in them"]],[2557,["which they should get rid of it. Completely."]],[2560,["You are the people who belong to God."]],[2564,["And why should you have any diffidence about it?"]],[2569,["But this diffidence"]],[2571,["is completely finished"]],[2576,["when you get this center awakened within you."]],[2581,["To get this center awakened, you have to do nothing."]],[2586,["The Kundalini herself rises,"]],[2588,["and if you have any problem in that center, she comes back;"]],[2592,["again she rises with a greater force and hits there,"]],[2596,["opens it out and awakens the deity of that center,"]],[2602,["so that you feel very confident."]],[2605,["Today, if you see, Dr. Warren so confident."]],[2609,["I must tell you, he was not,"]],[2612,["he was quite diffident."]],[2615,["He thought you all are going to beat him"]],[2616,["when he tells you all these things."]],[2619,["But today he’s a changed man."]],[2624,["Now, we have on the right-hand side of this,"]],[2627,["is another part of the center, which we call as right Heart."]],[2632,["This center is the father’s center,"]],[2634,["and the left Heart is the mother’s center."]],[2639,["So, if your fatherhood is challenged in any way —"]],[2644,["or, also, husband-wise, we can say it like that —"]],[2647,["if a husband is not loyal to his wife"]],[2652,["and is playing tricks with her,"]],[2655,["he gets this into trouble."]],[2658,["But physically, he feels it very much"]],[2664,["because he gets asthma."]],[2669,["Asthma one develops,"]],[2671,["but this is more a center of the father."]],[2675,["If the fatherhood of a person is not all right,"]],[2677,["for example, if a girl has lost her father"]],[2682,["and she has never seen him, she might develop asthma."]],[2687,["If the grandfather had the asthma,"]],[2689,["the grandchild might develop the asthma."]],[2691,["It comes from the father’s side."]],[2694,["Anybody who has asthma problem should know"]],[2698,["that there's something wrong in the fatherhood side."]],[2701,["Maybe the father is sick and you are worried,"]],[2704,["maybe you are a good father, but the son is not all right,"]],[2708,["so you are suffering — anything like that, you see,"]],[2712,["could be responsible for this asthma."]],[2715,["But if the deity here is awakened, you can be all right,"]],[2720,["and you can get rid of your asthma, quite all right."]],[2724,["On the left-hand side is the center of your mother."]],[2729,["If the mother has died very early,"]],[2734,["such a person is a nervous person,"]],[2737,["and such a person also doesn’t trust anyone."]],[2741,["He can become secretive by nature, sulking type."]],[2745,["He may not open his heart to anyone, because he doesn’t trust anyone."]],[2751,["Some people who have no mother,"]],[2753,["whom they have not known,"]],[2755,["can become extremely cautious by nature"]],[2759,["because they think they have to look after themselves."]],[2763,["Extremely cautious."]],[2764,["But with Sahaja Yoga, you can awaken this center,"]],[2769,["and you become a complete personality,"]],[2773,["without any fear, without any nervousness,"]],[2776,["and without any malice to your parents."]],[2779,["Actually, after Sahaja Yoga, I’ve found,"]],[2781,["many people who have just forgotten their parents,"]],[2786,["had been very angry with their parents,"]],[2788,["given them up, could not forgive them —"]],[2791,["went back to their parents."]],[2793,["We had a French girl in England"]],[2797,["who had not seen her mother for eighteen years,"]],[2800,["and the mother was alone, a widow lady."]],[2803,["But after the realization, she has a tremendous feeling;"]],[2807,["she went back and looked after her mother,"]],[2810,["and also started doing Sahaja Yoga there."]],[2813,["It’s not … it’s a very very common thing"]],[2816,["that you start expanding your heart to others."]],[2819,["You start loving other people,"]],[2822,["you start understanding them."]],[2824,["I know of a man in America — I gave him realization —"]],[2828,["and he said, “Most surprising, I went to the race this time."]],[2832,["I said this would be the last I go to the race."]],[2834,["And there I find my uncle, and I wished him;"]],[2838,["and he was amazed, he started looking at me,"]],[2840,["because I had not wished him all these years at all."]],[2843,["He just started, he was quite amazed at my attitude."]],[2846,["And now he has become a great friend of mine.”"]],[2848,["So the friendship —"]],[2850,["which is a pure friendship, this homosexual and all nonsense —"]],[2854,["but a pure friendship based on pure relationship develops."]],[2861,["And then you don’t feel insecure."]],[2863,["In a society where even a mother’s love is challenged,"]],[2868,["one would feel extremely insecure in a thing like that."]],[2872,["If a mother has to love the child, she has to think,"]],[2875,["“I hope there is no bad feeling in my mind.”"]],[2878,["In America it happened: there was a little boy of eight years,"]],[2881,["just a little boy of eight years."]],[2884,["And her mother said that she has started taking"]],[2888,["lot of drugs and things,"]],[2891,["and these drugs have created a problem"]],[2895,["for this little boy of eight years, can you imagine?"]],[2899,["So I couldn’t bear it, I just took the boy to My heart,"]],[2903,["and I kissed him."]],[2905,["He said, “Mother, this is never done to me by my mother.”"]],[2910,["So I asked the lady, “Why didn’t you do this to your child?"]],[2914,["He’s only eight years of age, doesn’t he love your care,"]],[2919,["and your expression of your love?”"]],[2921,["So she said, “Mother, I feel guilty.” I said, “How?” —"]],[2925,["“Freud has said…” Freud was a perverted useless fellow!"]],[2928,["He died of cancer, look at his life!"]],[2931,["These psychologists, when they come in contact with others,"]],[2937,["people who are suffering from pathological troubles —"]],[2940,["they are pathological cases —"]],[2942,["and when they deal with pathological cases,"]],[2945,["they don’t know how to protect them. Jung has said about it."]],[2948,["Then they catch those diseases among themselves,"]],[2951,["and they start generalizing this for everyone."]],[2953,["They have generalized, it’s an absurd thing!"]],[2957,["In Rome, there was a girl who came to Me, she said,"]],[2960,["“Ah, psychologists, horrid, horrid, horrid!”"]],[2962,["I said, “What happened?” — “They are telling me I have bad eyes"]],[2966,["towards my father. I felt like beating them!”"]],[2970,["It's all absurd things, you see, to create — this is anti-Christ —"]],[2974,["to create a feeling of enmity,"]],[2979,["that everything is perverted, polluted."]],[2982,["It’s so pure!"]],[2984,["In India nobody can understand this."]],[2986,["Thank God this Freud and all these people just touched"]],[2989,["the periphery of India, and it’s like an elephant:"]],[2993,["so nobody is there, and it’s just gone … nobody believes in it."]],[2998,["So, I have to tell you this, that there is no such thing"]],[3002,["as polluted relationship or bad relationship."]],[3007,["It’s all pure relationships."]],[3010,["We must understand we are not animals."]],[3012,["Even animals have got sense, so do you think we won’t have"]],[3016,["the sense of purity within us and holiness within us?"]],[3021,["So all these ideas also drop out completely,"]],[3025,["and you develop a personality."]],[3027,["You live with others: in the ashram now we have"]],[3029,["many girls, boys, this — they’re all are like brothers and sisters."]],[3034,["There is no problem on that."]],[3036,["Now, we have the other centre,"]],[3038,["which we call as the Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[3041,["This is a very very important center"]],[3045,["which is bestowed upon by Shri Krishna Himself."]],[3049,["The right Heart by Shri Rama, and left Heart by Uma,"]],[3053,["or we can call Her the wife of Shiva;"]],[3057,["while the centre Heart is bestowed upon by the Mother,"]],[3061,["called Jagadamba, who is the one"]],[3064,["who helps people to cross this ocean of illusion,"]],[3069,["and to protect them. This is the Divine Mother."]],[3072,["The other day you were asking Me about Divine Mother —"]],[3074,["this is one of the glimpse of Her."]],[3076,["So now the other center which we have here"]],[3079,["is very important center, called as the Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[3083,["This is the center Vi-shuddha. One is “shuddha”, means “pure”,"]],[3087,["but “vishuddha” means “absolutely pure”."]],[3091,["This has got sixteen petals,"]],[3094,["as we have got the cervical plexus expressed in the gross,"]],[3098,["which has also got sixteen sub-plexuses."]],[3102,["It tallies with medical science completely."]],[3106,["Now, this Vishuddhi Chakra is bestowed upon"]],[3109,["by the deity of Shri Krishna."]],[3114,["Shri Krishna is the one which is the evolution"]],[3118,["of the Vishnu Tattwa [Vishnu Principle] from there"]],[3121,["upward to the state of Primordial Being."]],[3127,["He is the one who resides"]],[3131,["as the Primordial Being, as the Whole, as the Akbar."]],[3135,["When Mohammed Sahib talked of Akbar, he talked of Shri Krishna."]],[3140,["This is the finger which represents this center,"]],[3144,["and He said: “Put these into your ears"]],[3148,["and say ‘Allah hu Akbar’ —"]],[3150,["you get in connection with the Virat.”"]],[3155,["Now, what Sahaja Yoga does is to make you"]],[3158,["in contact with the whole."]],[3161,["It makes you in contact with the whole."]],[3163,["It’s not that it limits you,"]],[3166,["but it makes you one with the whole."]],[3169,["So one must understand"]],[3171,["that what you have to achieve in your realization"]],[3174,["is just not talk of Shri Krishna, just thinking, singing about —"]],[3178,["which is absurd! People don’t understand!"]],[3181,["That in Oxford Street we find people"]],[3183,["with all these nonsensical things going on;"]],[3186,["begging, asking for alms…"]],[3189,["I feel it’s such an insult to Shri Krishna"]],[3192,["that people in His name are begging."]],[3196,["But it’s done in all religious movements"]],[3199,["that people beg in the name of God."]],[3202,["There is no need to beg."]],[3204,["First you equip yourself with the blessings of God"]],[3208,["that there is no need for you to beg at all."]],[3210,["And begging is against God’s realization,"]],[3215,["against Self-realization."]],[3217,["You must have self-esteem. That’s one thing very important."]],[3221,["If you do not have self-esteem, you cannot get realization."]],[3225,["Why should you go on the streets and beg?"]],[3227,["It's absolutely absurd, it's a showing-off thing,"]],[3231,["which is of no use to yourself."]],[3234,["By doing this, you are really corrupting the name of Shri Krishna."]],[3239,["But if you take to the right path,"]],[3242,["if this center is awakened,"]],[3244,["your hands become connected with the Primordial Being,"]],[3248,["and you become, your hands become collectively conscious."]],[3253,["Medically, they accept that the extremities"]],[3256,["have got something to do with the sympathetic nervous system."]],[3259,["That far, no more than that."]],[3262,["But in Sahaja Yoga, you’ll be amazed"]],[3264,["that the vibration starts flowing through your hand"]],[3267,["when you take the name of Shri Krishna."]],[3270,["And these vibrations, when you want to find out what are these,"]],[3274,["then you’ll be amazed they relate to your centers within yourself."]],[3278,["Even if you get ten children who are realized souls,"]],[3281,["and tie their eyes, and ask them about a person"]],[3285,["who is sitting before them what’s wrong with him,"]],[3287,["they will say one finger, or this finger,"]],[3289,["or this finger, or two fingers."]],[3291,["Because you can feel the charring,"]],[3294,["you can feel sometimes a kind of a heat."]],[3297,["Sometimes you may feel the numbness."]],[3300,["If you feel the numbness on your fingers,"]],[3303,["then you must know that the person has to die."]],[3307,["So many things you can know, all the permutations"]],[3310,["of these seven centers and this one:"]],[3314,["one, five, and … six and seven."]],[3319,["So we have seven centers."]],[3322,["To understand about the centers,"]],[3324,["first you must get your realization, that is important."]],[3327,["In the beginning you’ll find the vibrations are coming, going,"]],[3330,["coming, going. It is not steady."]],[3333,["First you must steady yourself."]],[3335,["Then you can find out, from your hands,"]],[3338,["what are the centers catching."]],[3340,["Because these vibrations are nothing"]],[3342,["but the Power of God is flowing through you."]],[3346,["They understand, these vibrations, they co-ordinate."]],[3351,["They are life’s force."]],[3352,["They are the one who create all these living things"]],[3357,["like … they are the one who sprout a seed,"]],[3360,["they are the one who transform the flower into a fruit."]],[3367,["All living work is done by these vibrations,"]],[3370,["which is called as Chaitanya, Aum, Ruh,"]],[3375,["cool breeze of the Holy Ghost, and all-pervading Power of God."]],[3379,["That starts flowing through you, first time you feel them."]],[3382,["Yesterday many people felt it, and people were very happy"]],[3385,["that so many felt it, because that’s a sign"]],[3388,["that here many people are going to get realization."]],[3395,["You don’t have to go to anybody,"]],[3397,["you have to just practice a little bit and find out."]],[3400,["You’ll become such an expert!"]],[3403,["One person in India who got realization"]],[3407,["has so far given realization to at least ten thousand people."]],[3412,["In a village. Many villages."]],[3415,["He’s a very ordinary man. We wanted him to come,"]],[3417,["but there was a kind of a visa problem, so he could not come."]],[3422,["He’s a very simple farmer, and he got his realization,"]],[3426,["and he knows so much about Sahaja Yoga that you’ll be amazed;"]],[3428,["he has not been to any university, to any college or anything,"]],[3432,["but he’s so knowledgeable."]],[3434,["Because once you have these vibrations they guide you."]],[3437,["So the Spirit sitting in your heart"]],[3442,["guides you and tells you what is right and what is wrong."]],[3447,["If you have to ask a question: “Mother, is there God?” —"]],[3452,["if you ask this question, immediately there will be"]],[3454,["a tremendous flow saying that it is there."]],[3458,["Now, how to understand that these are the vibrations of God,"]],[3462,["also this question can come."]],[3464,["We can judge them relatively."]],[3466,["For example, in one of the programs in Pune,"]],[3470,["people invited Me to speak"]],[3473,["in a place which was owned by brahmins, and they opposed it."]],[3476,["They said, “She’s not a brahmin, so we will not have her here.”"]],[3479,["So they said, “All right, we’ll publish in the newspaper —"]],[3482,["because Her name has gone in the newspaper — we’ll tell them"]],[3484,["that these people are so ‘brahminic’ that they don’t want to have Her.”"]],[3487,["Of course, they didn’t want to have that bad name,"]],[3490,["so they said, “All right, let’s have her.”"]],[3492,["These people never told Me what had happened."]],[3494,["Suddenly I said, “Those who think who are brahmins, come down.”"]],[3499,["So four-five of them came and sat before Me."]],[3502,["These are brahmins without knowing the Brahma!"]],[3504,["So I said, “All right, put your hands before Me.”"]],[3506,["And they just started shaking like this, going back."]],[3509,["I said, “What’s happening to you?”"]],[3511,["So they said, “Mother, you are Shakti,"]],[3513,["that’s why it is happening to me, to us,”"]],[3515,["but I said, “What about others? It’s not happening to others.”"]],[3518,["So they turned round and said, “Look at these,"]],[3520,["they are also doing like this.”"]],[3522,["I said, “Ask them from where do they come.”"]],[3524,["They went and asked them; they said, “We are coming"]],[3526,["from the lunatic asylum of Thane.”"]],[3529,["So these fanatics, who believed that they were brahmins,"]],[3532,["were reacting the same way as these lunatics."]],[3537,["And they believed that they were brahmins,"]],[3539,["they were not supposed to touch anybody,"]],[3540,["they were “untouchables” people, and they were …"]],[3543,["the one who gave them realization was from so-called untouchable,"]],[3549,["a shoemaker."]],[3551,["Now he’s become their guru, of all these brahmins,"]],[3553,["and he’s teaching them about God."]],[3556,["So this center gives you the power"]],[3560,["to be one with the whole."]],[3562,["It has many powers, but the main power it gives you"]],[3566,["is the power to be one with the whole"]],[3569,["and to have all the powers of that deity within you awakened,"]],[3574,["so that you can become aware"]],[3579,["and make others also aware of it."]],[3583,["Those people who talk too much catch on the right Vishuddhi,"]],[3587,["those who do not talk at all catch on the left."]],[3590,["Those who feel guilty catch on the left,"]],[3592,["those who think they are all right and aggressive,"]],[3595,["they catch on the right. It’s like that."]],[3597,["So this has to be understood in right perspective:"]],[3601,["that if you misuse this center, what happens to you,"]],[3605,["so how you should give yourself a balance to improve that."]],[3610,["But the best part of Sahaja Yoga is this:"]],[3612,["that when you get them realization,"]],[3616,["they are separated from themselves."]],[3618,["They’ll come and tell Me, “Mother, my Agnya Chakra is catching.”"]],[3621,["So, if you ask them, “Really?” — “Yes, Mother, very much.”"]],[3625,["That means they are suffering from too much ego."]],[3629,["But can you imagine anybody saying,"]],[3631,["“Mother, I’m suffering from too much ego”?"]],[3633,["Because you are separated from yourself, you see your ego,"]],[3636,["the big balloonic-like thing,"]],[3638,["and you say, “Mother, please remove my ego.”"]],[3640,["That is how people talk to Me."]],[3642,["They will tell Me: “Mother, I talk too much,"]],[3644,["that’s why my right Vishuddhi is catching."]],[3646,["You better cure it, I must stop my talking too much.”"]],[3649,["So you start correcting yourself"]],[3651,["because you get separated from yourself,"]],[3654,["you become the Spirit; and the rest you see."]],[3657,["Like I see My sari: if there’s a spot,"]],[3660,["I would like to clean it, I’m not identified with the spot."]],[3663,["So, that’s how it happens; you are no more identified with yourself,"]],[3667,["and you start seeing the faults in you, and you try to correct it."]],[3670,["That’s how you become a beautiful person — by your own attention,"]],[3674,["not by anybody else, it is you who has to do it."]],[3678,["Now, we have a very important center here"]],[3683,["called as Agnya Chakra."]],[3686,["This is bestowed upon"]],[3688,["by the great incarnation of Lord Jesus Christ."]],[3693,["We have no idea as to how this incarnation"]],[3697,["has come on this earth."]],[3699,["Because if you just read Bible, it is a little bit of Christ we see."]],[3704,["They allowed Him to live only for about four years"]],[3707,["to talk to people; within four years He was killed."]],[3712,["So He had no time to tell you all about it."]],[3716,["But He did the job what He was supposed to do"]],[3719,["and which He achieved in His lifetime."]],[3722,["But if you read some books,"]],[3724,["in other scriptures like Devi Mahatmyam,"]],[3727,["where the Goddess was the one who created Him —"]],[3734,["and how She created, and what She did to Him,"]],[3738,["and everything is given in detail —"]],[3740,["and in every detail, you’ll be surprised, is the life of Christ."]],[3744,["Only thing, there He is called as Mahavishnu and not as Christ."]],[3748,["But even the name of Christ comes to Him"]],[3752,["from the same heritage which I was telling you:"]],[3754,["that His name was Yeshu, not Jesus,"]],[3757,["because, in the Bible, I get Myself confused when I read"]],[3760,["that Anna was not Anna, it was Hannah, John was Johann —"]],[3766,["every name has been corrupted in the English Bible."]],[3769,["In the same way they have corrupted Christ’s name, Yeshu, into Jesus."]],[3774,["Actually, they call Him — some people, of course — call Him Jesu."]],[3777,["This is the name given to Him by Shri Radhaji,"]],[3781,["the one who was the power of Shri Krishna."]],[3784,["She's the one who gave Him this name"]],[3787,["because She was very much indebted"]],[3790,["to the foster mother of Shri Krishna, who was Yeshoda,"]],[3794,["and that’s why She called Him Yeshu."]],[3797,["“Yeshu” is the word in Hebrew language,"]],[3800,["and we call Yeshoda as Yeshu;"]],[3802,["also some people, in a … what you call … in a country language,"]],[3806,["also call the same thing as Jesu."]],[3808,["You know that Y and J is always sort of"]],[3812,["brought together in that way: like Yugoslavia, we call it —"]],[3815,["they call it Jugoslavia."]],[3817,["So His name Yeshu came from that,"]],[3820,["and that’s how He was created a special one."]],[3823,["In the Devi Mahatmyam it is said that Krishna has said"]],[3827,["that “You will become the support of the universe.”"]],[3832,["Now, in India, people and seers were waiting for Mahavishnu"]],[3836,["to come and tell them that, Mahavishnu has been born."]],[3841,["But the people who went to India,"]],[3843,["they had Bible in one hand and the pistol in another hand,"]],[3846,["or a big gun, or maybe a huge big cannon."]],[3850,["And that’s how they entered India,"]],[3852,["and they said that “You must get converted.”"]],[3855,["Now, what is a “conversion” God only knows. You can take a donkey"]],[3858,["and put a thing on that “You are a Christian” —"]],[3860,["you don’t become a Christian."]],[3862,["That’s how they spread Christianity throughout India,"]],[3864,["which was all absurd type of Christianity."]],[3867,["I was also born in one of the Protestant Christian families."]],[3872,["My father was a realized soul, My mother was another,"]],[3875,["they were very learned people."]],[3877,["And My father told Me, “God, look at this now,"]],[3880,["what are these Christians doing to Christ!”"]],[3883,["And he was the one who fought for Independence,"]],[3888,["he went to jail, My mother went to jail, and he was member"]],[3891,["of our constituent assembly, parliament and all that,"]],[3894,["but Christians only started recognizing him"]],[3897,["when he became a member of something or a mayor of a place."]],[3900,["They had no other idea of a person,"]],[3902,["that somebody has Spiritual endowment"]],[3905,["or any sort of a Spiritual powers."]],[3908,["Now, in our family,"]],[3911,["we were very much with Gandhiji, all of us;"]],[3915,["we had sacrificed a lot for the country,"]],[3917,["and My father decided to marry us all out of community,"]],[3920,["not among Christians, because he thought these Christians"]],[3923,["are so much worshipping these missionaries:"]],[3926,["they would even pray for their health,"]],[3930,["the health of their dog, and health of their umbrellas."]],[3934,["It was such a wretched condition of these Christians in those days;"]],[3937,["I mean, they were so dedicated to these missionaries."]],[3941,["The missionaries were only busy converting people."]],[3945,["Now, this Mahavishnu Tattwa — the one who was born as Christ —"]],[3949,["was never understood, never told,"]],[3952,["they never read anything about it they never found out."]],[3955,["So, Indians believed that so far Mahavishnu is not born,"]],[3960,["and so it continued with the idea"]],[3963,["that we have to still go on."]],[3965,["Because in the principle Mahavishnu it was written"]],[3968,["that “Not only You will be the support of the universe,"]],[3972,["but You will have such purity within You,” —"]],[3974,["because He is the Omkara, He’s the Chaitanya,"]],[3977,["He’s the vibrations, that’s why He could walk,"]],[3980,["that’s why He was resurrected —"]],[3982,["that it was said that when His Advent will come,"]],[3987,["He will cross this path —"]],[3990,["this is the cross, the resurrection part —"]],[3993,["and, by His advancement,"]],[3995,["He will be able to suck in"]],[3998,["the ego and superego within you, the karmas,"]],[4001,["the conditionings, the ego in you,"]],[4003,["by which people will get their realization."]],[4007,["So Indians continued with the idea"]],[4010,["that “We have to still pay for our karmas, Mahavishnu has not come.”"]],[4015,["Because of misrepresentation."]],[4017,["Once I told them that Christ was Mahavishnu, you see,"]],[4020,["thousands are getting realization because they believe in Mahavishnu,"]],[4023,["they of course respect Christ very much, but they did not know"]],[4026,["that He was Mahavishnu; if He’s Mahavishnu, it’s perfect!"]],[4030,["And that’s how He was enlightened, and He got -"]],[4033,["the people got their realization in no time."]],[4036,["Because they are educated in it, they know what it is."]],[4039,["You see, these missionaries just read some Bible"]],[4041,["in some schools and all that and came down."]],[4044,["But they did not know how to correlate the whole thing."]],[4047,["You see, it cannot be truth just in Bible,"]],[4049,["it has to be everywhere."]],[4052,["And that is what happened when they came down"]],[4055,["and they told us something which was not Christ."]],[4062,["Now, this thing happens to us also:"]],[4064,["that when Kundalini rises,"]],[4066,["Christ is born within you here, He’s awakened within you."]],[4071,["And when He is awakened, the ego and superego both are sucked in,"]],[4075,["and you get a space here;"]],[4077,["and when you get that space here, the Kundalini shoots off,"]],[4080,["and that’s how you feel the cool breeze on your head."]],[4086,["I have given at least seven lectures continuously on Christ"]],[4090,["in a church called as Unity Church."]],[4094,["It was, again, the unity and fraternity"]],[4096,["of all the horrible people."]],[4099,["They were preaching about Rajneesh, preaching about …"]],[4102,["at least Rajneesh is antichrist, anybody can see."]],[4105,["When Christ has said: “Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes” —"]],[4109,["to that extent His purity has gone —"]],[4112,["how can you accept Rajneesh as a guru for any Spirituality?"]],[4116,["But they had books from all kinds of horrible people."]],[4119,["They had no books which were ancient books with them,"]],[4122,["nothing, no knowledge of any kind!"]],[4124,["Indians don’t depend — the real Indians, I mean,"]],[4127,["not the westernized pseudo-Indians"]],[4129,["who have been to Cambridge and Oxford —"]],[4131,["but those who are real Indians don’t depend on these books:"]],[4133,["they think it’s all trash that has come and will go away,"]],[4136,["it has no meaning."]],[4138,["And they had all these books put there to destroy."]],[4144,["Really the unity within us lies —"]],[4146,["when you become collectively conscious."]],[4149,["All this work has been done in the ancient times."]],[4153,["As Mohammed was one of the Prophets who came,"]],[4156,["out of the ten Prophets: Moses, Abraham,"]],[4160,["Lao Tse …"]],[4164,["then we had also people like other Prophets …"]],[4169,["Socrates…"]],[4171,["Recently, we had in India the last one,"]],[4174,["is the Sai Nath — not the “Satya” one, but the Sai Nath —"]],[4179,["who lived … who was representing"]],[4181,["this great principle of Primordial Master."]],[4187,["So this is the story of your evolution."]],[4191,["The last is the most important center, is the Sahasrara,"]],[4195,["which is open today, open from 1970, 5 May,"]],[4202,["that we can feel the Sahasrara opening out."]],[4208,["About this center also, if you go to My center,"]],[4211,["you’ll find many, many tapes"]],[4214,["which will explain to you this center."]],[4216,["The only thing is that all the seats"]],[4219,["of all the subtle centers within us"]],[4224,["lie along the line like this."]],[4227,["And all the centers are within us. This is the Agnya Chakra."]],[4231,["And that’s how it moves: this is the Vishuddhi Chakra,"]],[4234,["this is the Heart, this is the Nabhi,"]],[4239,["what you call the solar plexus;"]],[4241,["then we have got, in the center here, is the Mooladhara,"]],[4246,["and around it is what you call the Swadhishthana."]],[4251,["That’s why when Swadhishthana goes out"]],[4253,["or you get diabetes, you get blindness."]],[4256,["Blindness is due to the fact that your Swadhisthana is not all right."]],[4260,["Many people get blind when their eyes open —"]],[4262,["can be cured by Sahaja Yoga."]],[4265,["In Geneva I cured a lady in ten minutes time."]],[4268,["It’s all due to possessions that you get here."]],[4270,["Coming to the Agnya Chakra, one has to say that all these chakras"]],[4274,["have movement on both the sides:"]],[4276,["one moves to the collective subconscious,"]],[4278,["another moves to the collective supraconscious."]],[4281,["Now, if at the Agnya Chakra you start moving like that,"]],[4284,["in the collective subconscious you start seeing"]],[4288,["all the dead things:"]],[4290,["like great deities,"]],[4294,["or you can also start think … past, we can say."]],[4297,["If you move to the right, then you start seeing colors,"]],[4301,["and also you start seeing lights and all those things."]],[4305,["With LSD also you can do it."]],[4307,["If you take LSD … many people who used to take LSD"]],[4310,["and were suffering from coma just came to Me,"]],[4313,["and they just never saw Me, they just saw the lights."]],[4316,["So, that is not the right thing to see Me as light"]],[4320,["or as some previous deity —"]],[4322,["is to see Me as I am, is the present."]],[4325,["So we have to be in the present."]],[4327,["Sahaja Yoga brings you to the present moment,"]],[4331,["by which you enjoy every moment of life in its all dynamics,"]],[4336,["and that’s how you become a dynamic,"]],[4338,["loving, affectionate, relaxed personality."]],[4343,["May God bless you all!"]],[4345,["Thank you very much, three days have been very good."]],[4347,["I would expect you also to come on Sunday morning —"]],[4352,["not at seven o’clock as he said but at ten o’clock —"]],[4355,["Sunday morning to our ashram, which he will tell you the address."]],[4360,["Please come along, and you can also have your lunch with us."]],[4364,["I hope we’ll be able to cook something for all of you."]],[4368,["Because this is your Mother’s house,"]],[4370,["and in a mother’s house you must at least eat your food."]],[4374,["That’s what it is. It’s very personal, it’s very intimate,"]],[4378,["it’s not like the guru sitting on the seventh storey"]],[4381,["and all everybody bowing to him, it’s not like that."]],[4383,["It’s absolutely personal, individual,"]],[4386,["and everybody is given full, proper attention"]],[4390,["and respect in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4393,["May God bless you!"]],[4408,["Today we’ll not have any questions,"]],[4410,["because we have had too many of them before and wasted lot of time."]],[4414,["Let us have it without questions;"]],[4416,["without asking anything you can get your realization."]],[4419,["So tell your mind to ask questions later on."]],[4421,["Once you have got realization, you won’t ask,"]],[4424,["so just tell your mind, which is working all the time"]],[4427,["and giving you some ideas, tell it to wait."]],[4430,["Because by thinking you have achieved nothing so far,"]],[4433,["by mental conception you have not achieved anything."]],[4437,["Because, after all, this mind is a limited thing,"]],[4440,["and you have to be triggered into unlimited space,"]],[4443,["and for that, if you think, you cannot reach there."]],[4446,["So, actually, first thing that happens to you —"]],[4449,["that your thought stops when the Kundalini crosses Agnya."]],[4453,["And when you feel this cool breeze,"]],[4455,["you absolutely get calmed down and relaxed."]],[4458,["Yesterday was a great experience for people."]],[4461,["I’m sure today also it will work out the same way."]],[4464,["You have to do exactly as I tell you,"]],[4466,["which is a very simple thing, you don’t have to do anything great,"]],[4469,["just take out your shoes because this Mother Earth helps us."]],[4473,["Just take out your shoes."]],[4512,["Just take out your shoes, sit comfortably;"]],[4518,["if you have anything tight on your body,"]],[4520,["just remove it, but keep yourself comfortable."]],[4523,["Put your hands on your laps."]],[4525,["One thing is, you have to be comfortable,"]],[4527,["so that during the process"]],[4529,["you don’t feel any uncomfortable feeling."]],[4532,["So, please just put your right hands …"]],[4535,["both the hands towards Me first of all, just hands like this."]],[4540,["Now you have to close your eyes."]],[4544,["Please don’t open your eyes."]],[4546,["Because if you open your eyes,"]],[4548,["the Kundalini won’t cross the Agnya Chakra."]],[4551,["So please don’t open your eyes till I tell you."]],[4553,["It’s nothing is going to happen, there’s nothing to have any fear,"]],[4557,["everything is going to be all right."]],[4560,["But I must warn: some people have a habit of showing off,"]],[4563,["and they start going into a funny …"]],[4568,["contortions and this — that is not needed at all here."]],[4571,["It’s something that happens inside, antar-yoga."]],[4574,["Nothing happens outside, it happens inside,"]],[4577,["so be sensible and wise."]],[4579,["Take your realization — is the best thing that you can do to yourself"]],[4583,["and to anybody else."]],[4585,["So put your both the hands towards Me"]],[4587,["and just close your eyes."]],[4595,["Just close your eyes, all of you should close your eyes."]],[4599,["Even if you have spectacles, you can remove"]],[4601,["because it also improves your eyesight; so remove your spectacles."]],[4605,["Sit very comfortably. Don’t worry about others,"]],[4609,["just now you have to think about yourself."]],[4614,["Now, left hand, as he said,"]],[4617,["is the power of desire,"]],[4620,["so put it … left hand on your lap towards Me."]],[4624,["That is not to be removed."]],[4626,["Only use your right hand to raise your Kundalini"]],[4629,["on different chakras on the left-hand side throughout."]],[4633,["So we put our right hand on the heart. With full confidence!"]],[4637,["Now, as I have said, you have to have confidence!"]],[4643,["On the heart. If there is anything in your pocket,"]],[4646,["you better take out, and if it’s a coat or anything, put it inside."]],[4649,["Put it on your heart, press it a little bit"]],[4653,["and say with full confidence,"]],[4656,["“Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[4659,["Feel no hesitation in saying that — you are the Spirit!"]],[4666,["You are not the body, mind, and this ego, you are the Spirit."]],[4672,["Close your eyes, all of you, keep your eyes shut."]],[4677,["Even if they’re not shutting, try to press them a little,"]],[4681,["they’ll shut down."]],[4683,["They must relax."]],[4695,["Don’t say mechanically. With full confidence, I said,"]],[4699,["please say, “Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[4708,["Now put down this hand on the left-hand side,"]],[4712,["on the left-hand side of your stomach."]],[4716,["Now, this is very good for you"]],[4719,["because the principle of guru"]],[4722,["resides in the stomach area."]],[4726,["So you put your right hand on the stomach on the left-hand side"]],[4730,["and press it a little bit with your fingers, fingertips."]],[4735,["At this point you have to say ten times,"]],[4739,["“Mother, I am my own guru.”"]],[4741,["Again, with great confidence and understanding"]],[4743,["and respect for yourself, with all your self-esteem:"]],[4747,["“Mother, I am my own guru.”"]],[4754,["Please put your left hand straight towards Me."]],[4758,["Both the legs should be straight on the ground,"]],[4760,["little apart from each other. Little apart from each other."]],[4767,["It’s good."]],[4772,["Now."]],[4773,["You raise your right hand now upward,"]],[4778,["again to your heart position,"]],[4781,["put it on your heart again."]],[4784,["And now twelve times you have to say,"]],[4787,["“Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[4856,["Now put the same hand on the left-hand side of your neck."]],[4862,["Why don’t you do, is a good chance."]],[4865,["Just try, just try, it will work out. Close your eyes."]],[4868,["Be a little attentive, be little attentive."]],[4870,["It will work out, it’s very simple."]],[4873,["Right hand on the left-hand side of your neck,"]],[4877,["on the left Vishuddhi, as we call it."]],[4879,["At this point, sixteen times you have to say,"]],[4883,["“Mother, I am not guilty,”"]],[4885,["because you have been feeling guilty for nothing at all."]],[4888,["Sixteen times, there are sixteen sub-plexuses."]],[4891,["You have to say sixteen times,"]],[4896,["with full confidence: “Mother, I am not guilty.”"]],[4902,["All right."]],[4905,["Now raise this right hand onto your forehead,"]],[4909,["after saying sixteen times."]],[4920,["At this point, you have to say, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[4924,["Because you know this is the center of Christ,"]],[4927,["and Lord Jesus Christ has given us a prayer"]],[4930,["which is the mantra, which is the chanting of this center is,"]],[4934,["so you have to say, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[4936,["Because if we do not forgive others,"]],[4939,["God is not going to forgive us."]],[4949,["Without feeling guilty, you have to say,"]],[4953,["“God, forgive us because we forgive all those"]],[4957,["who have done harm to us.”"]],[4962,["Without feeling guilty, again I’m saying,"]],[4964,["without feeling guilty, with all confidence."]],[4967,["The guilt is too much in you people."]],[4969,["What is the guilt for, you see, what are you guilty of?"]],[4973,["As I have said yesterday, God is the ocean of love,"]],[4979,["ocean of forgiveness,"]],[4982,["ocean of compassion."]],[4986,["Trust Him."]],[4990,["Not to feel guilty, and say that “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[4995,["Now put this hand on top of your head."]],[4999,["On top of your head where it’s a fontanelle bone area,"]],[5002,["which was a soft bone in your childhood — and try to press it."]],[5008,["You’ll find a little heat coming out."]],[5011,["Now raise the hand little higher, about four inches,"]],[5016,["and see if there’s a cool breeze coming out."]],[5022,["If not, change the hand: put your right hand towards Me"]],[5026,["and left hand on top of your head."]],[5029,["Otherwise also you can do it."]],[5035,["Again change over, again and again,"]],[5038,["and see if there’s a cool breeze coming out."]],[5043,["At this point, you have to ask for your realization."]],[5048,["I cannot cross your freedom, so you have to say,"]],[5051,["“Mother, I want my realization.”"]],[5053,["“Mother, I want my realization”, “Please give me my realization” —"]],[5057,["anything like that."]],[5065,["It’s all right."]],[5069,["Now you may open your eyes"]],[5073,["and put your hands like this, just like this."]],[5076,["All of you put your hands and ask a question in your heart:"]],[5080,["“Mother, is this the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost?"]],[5085,["Is this the Brahma Shakti?"]],[5087,["Is this the all-pervading Power of God?”"]],[5096,["Great."]],[5099,["The breeze you are feeling is not the breeze"]],[5101,["from any air conditioner or anything, is the breeze."]],[5106,["Now put down your hands and see for yourself."]],[5113,["Again I’ll tell you how to raise your own Kundalini."]],[5117,["Please follow me."]],[5118,["This will take about two minutes more,"]],[5121,["but it will help you to establish yourself."]],[5125,["We have left hand in front of the Kundalini, like this,"]],[5130,["and you have to move the right hand up, forward,"]],[5134,["lower, backward, like that, you have to move. Now, start it off."]],[5138,["Keep your eyes open, start moving your Kundalini."]],[5142,["Other way round, other way round. Other way round."]],[5145,["Just see how I’m doing it."]],[5148,["Now, take it up on your head. Take it up on your head,"]],[5152,["stretch your hands up there and give it a twist,"]],[5154,["a nice twist, and give a knot to your Kundalini."]],[5158,["Because your hands are now powerful,"]],[5160,["you are working through your hands. Now again start it."]],[5163,["Do it again, but do it properly;"]],[5165,["you should do it this way, as I am saying it to you,"]],[5168,["not the other way round."]],[5171,["Now take your hand up there, give it a twist again,"]],[5175,["and give it one knot."]],[5177,["For the third time, you have to give three knots"]],[5180,["because of three powers. Let’s do it again please."]],[5183,["Do it with full understanding that your hands are powerful,"]],[5188,["there is power flowing through your hands."]],[5190,["Only thing that you want — that it should be established."]],[5193,["Now, one …"]],[5197,["it’s two …"]],[5201,["it’s three."]],[5202,["Now see in your hands how do you feel."]],[5208,["All right?"]],[5214,["Those who came for the last two days definitely are feeling."]],[5218,["Even the people who came yesterday might be feeling, most of them."]],[5221,["Those who have come for the first time may not be,"]],[5224,["but doesn’t matter, it is going to work out."]],[5226,["You are all going to come and see Me on Sunday."]],[5229,["I’ll be very happy to meet all of you."]],[5232,["Now, if you have any personal problems,"]],[5234,["you can come and see Me just now."]],[5236,["Thank you very much. But not for a long time."]],[5239,["It’s already nine o’clock, so for about half an hour I’ll be here."]],[5244,["Thank you very much. But when you come on Sunday,"]],[5246,["please bring some sugar, salt, and oil with you."]],[5251,["And water."]],[5253,["Not too much, little bit."]],[5255,["But not so little also,"]],[5257,["bring at least half a kilo, or a quarter of a kilo."]],[5267,["Just come along. You got it? May God bless you!"]],[5272,["SEEKER: Thank You very much! I love You!"]],[5273,["SHRI MATAJI: That’s your own! That’s your own,"]],[5275,["what is there to thank Me. It's your own, it's your own."]],[5280,["Come along. Yes."]]]);
